# ESP-IDF and local build outputs
**/build/
**/build-*/
**/managed_components/
**/sdkconfig
**/sdkconfig.old

# G32 source overlays happen to use vendor directories named "build".
!g32s10x/sdk-integration-examples/port/g32/vendor_overrides/package/build/
!g32s10x/sdk-integration-examples/port/g32/vendor_overrides/package/build/build.mk
!g32s10x/complete-applications/device-monitor/integration/vendor_overrides/build/
!g32s10x/complete-applications/device-monitor/integration/vendor_overrides/build/fs.mk

# Firmware release outputs belong to GitHub Releases
**/release_assets/
**/artifacts/
**/releases/
*.bin
*.elf
*.map
*.yaffs2
*.uf2
*.hex
*.zip
*.tgz
*.tar.gz

